Env does not solve for macOS (no biobb_amber osx-arm64 build; osx-64 openmpi-ambertools conflict).

The biobb_amber 5.3.x macOS x86_64 builds require an openmpi-ambertools
build, whose old libboost/icu/zlib pins conflict with biobb_analysis 5.3.0's
gromacs 2026 chain (no installable provider), and no osx-arm64 build of
biobb_amber 5.3.x exists at all.

Opts this workflow out of the macOS CI lane only (python-tests.yaml, via the
detect job); the ubuntu-latest lane and all container flavours are unaffected.
Delete this file once the osx-64 builds resolve (e.g. newer ambertools
rebuilds on conda-forge/bioconda).
